<title>CANADA: GM Canada sales rise 9.2 pct in May.</title>
<headline>GM Canada sales rise 9.2 pct in May.</headline>
<dateline>OSHAWA, Ontario 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>General Motors of Canada Ltd, a wholly owned unit of General Motors Corp, said on Wednesday its sales for May were as follows:</p>
<p>		     PCT CHANGE	    1997	     1996</p>
<p>   Total	    +9.2		   45,364	   41,548</p>
<p>   Cars	    +10.1		   27,090	   24,606</p>
<p>   Trucks	   +7.9		   18,274	   16,942</p>
<p>   YEAR-TO-DATE  PCT CHANGE	    1997	     1996</p>
<p>   Total	   +13.3		  183,537	  162,056</p>
<p>   Cars	    +12.8		  105,650	   93,702</p>
<p>   Trucks	  +13.9		   77,887	   68,354</p>
<p>((Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100))</p>
</text>
